 01 L-TEXT                 PIC X(64).
 01 L-LENGTH               BINARY-LONG.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING CLIENT-STATE L-CONN L-TEXT L-LENGTH.
     IF WS-READY = 0
         CALL "PB-INIT" USING PB-BUFFER WS-CAPACITY
         MOVE 1 TO WS-READY
     END-IF
     CALL "PB-RESET" USING PB-BUFFER
