 01 L-CONN                 BINARY-LONG.
 01 L-EVENT                BINARY-LONG.
 01 L-VALUE                FLOAT-SHORT.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING CLIENT-STATE L-CONN L-EVENT L-VALUE.
     IF WS-READY = 0
         CALL "PB-INIT" USING PB-BUFFER WS-CAPACITY
         MOVE 1 TO WS-READY
     END-IF
     CALL "PB-RESET" USING PB-BUFFER
